<p>Sparfloxacin is considered the longest-acting <span class="customMeta" data-dictid="f4975edd0b1692777203b54cf45c2d">fluoroquinolone</span> (Half-life: 19 Hours), but it is not used due to safety concerns, particularly related to <span class="customMeta" data-dictid="e1fb96fd2416927771830dfed40e14">cardiac</span> arrhythmias.</p>
